---
name: security-audit
description: Comprehensive security audit workflow for codebase
---

Workflow:

security-scanner:"Scan for OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities":vulns ->
security-auditor:"Analyze vulnerabilities and rate severity":analysis ->
vulnerability-fixer:"Fix critical and high severity issues":fixes ->
security-reviewer:"Verify fixes and provide final report":report

---

## Security Audit Checklist

- [ ] Input validation (SQL injection, XSS, command injection)
- [ ] Authentication & authorization flows
- [ ] Secrets management (no hardcoded credentials)
- [ ] Dependency vulnerabilities (outdated packages)
- [ ] Business logic flaws
- [ ] Rate limiting and throttling
- [ ] Data exposure (PII, sensitive logs)

## Output

severity: critical | high | medium | low
issue: description
file: affected file
line: line number
fix: recommended remediation